# Container build context. These are inputs to the image release workflow, not
# runtime chart content, so they have no reason to sit in every published chart
# tarball. Nothing here is secret: images/radicle-seed/allowed_signers holds the
# upstream Radicle maintainers' *public* release-signing keys, which have to be
# published to be useful as a verification trust anchor.
images/
